Scope of the MIT license in this repository
===========================================

The MIT license in LICENSE covers what is actually in this repository: the
documentation, examples, manifests (server.json, glama.json) and the changelog.

The hosted FrankKi MCP server at https://mcp.frankki.app and the FrankKi
platform behind it are proprietary services. They are not distributed here and
are not covered by that license. Use of the service is governed by the terms at
https://frankki.app.

This note lives in NOTICE rather than in LICENSE on purpose. GitHub detects a
license by matching the text of LICENSE against a known license. Appending an
extra paragraph, even a clarifying one, drops the match below the detector's
confidence threshold, and the repository is then reported as "other" with SPDX
NOASSERTION. Downstream directories read that field: at least one of them grades
an undetected license as a failure and blocks installation on it. Keep LICENSE
byte-for-byte MIT and put clarifications here.
